00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:13.950
I'm doing this with you.  You're doing this to me!

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:17.530
I'm coming.  I'm gonna come!

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:31.180
Hey, Sora.

00:19:31.180 --> 00:19:31.880
What is it?

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:36.380
It's like I've been dreaming this whole time.

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:39.140
Ever since the day we first became one.

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:44.770
Even now, it's like I'm still in a dream.

00:19:46.430 --> 00:19:47.500
I'm home!

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:49.750
Come on in.

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.130
Excuse me.

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:53.710
You can use that room over there, Kana.

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:54.530
Okay.

00:19:54.530 --> 00:19:55.910
Aki-nee!

00:19:57.580 --> 00:19:58.410
Hmm?

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:00.190
Where's Sora-nii?

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:02.130
In the living room, maybe?

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:03.170
The living room?

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:09.920
Okay... now's my chance.

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:11.050
I need to hurry and get dressed.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:21.040
Sumiya-san?

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:24.280
Sumiya-san?

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:26.810
Huh?

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:28.310
Kana?

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:37.610
Maybe she's tired from too much stress?

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:02.450
I caught her cold...

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:10.110
Sorry.

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:11.870
Aki-neechan...

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:12.520
Hmm?

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:15.530
Stay with me, forever.

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:19.030
Yeah.

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:57.780
There's just one thought in my heart

00:21:57.980 --> 00:22:01.350
Thank you

00:22:17.050 --> 00:22:23.770
Didn't we meet by chance on the long road home?

00:22:23.770 --> 00:22:28.230
Let's go home together

00:22:28.770 --> 00:22:35.030
In my happiness, I can no longer hide these feelings

00:22:35.030 --> 00:22:41.030
Laughing.  I'm fine today, too.  What are you doing?

00:22:41.030 --> 00:22:47.040
So that you wouldn't notice me

00:22:47.040 --> 00:22:51.840
I walked just a little slowly

00:22:52.560 --> 00:22:58.630
I'm engrossed with how time flies by just like that

00:22:58.660 --> 00:23:04.480
Just by being with you

00:23:04.480 --> 00:23:10.690
If time won't stop for us, I'll wish over and over again

00:23:10.690 --> 00:23:17.150
Because I'd like to stay like this forever

00:23:17.150 --> 00:23:23.580
There's just one thought in my heart

00:23:23.580 --> 00:23:26.610
I love you

00:23:48.570 --> 00:23:50.080
It hurts.

00:23:50.080 --> 00:23:51.280
It hurts!

00:23:52.050 --> 00:23:53.780
This is a punishment.

00:23:53.780 --> 00:23:55.260
For committing a sin.

00:23:55.850 --> 00:23:58.030
I tried to lie to my heart.

00:23:58.860 --> 00:24:01.350
Does this mean that I shouldn't have?

00:24:02.270 --> 00:24:03.890
I don't know anymore.

00:24:04.400 --> 00:24:07.340
I don't know myself anymore.

00:24:07.830 --> 00:24:09.300
Tell me.

00:24:09.300 --> 00:24:10.940
Someone tell me!

00:24:11.680 --> 00:24:15.120
OVA Aki Sora.

00:24:15.120 --> 00:24:17.650
In a Dream, part 2.
